Use only current backend CTI kind strings in configurator selections and emitted steps.
Use local distributive builder input types because the shared API input aliases are currently non-distributive and hide kind-specific fields in page code.
=== CHANGES ===
Replaced builder form state with typed triggers, conditions, and actions arrays.
Refactored trigger, condition, and action configurators to edit typed backend step inputs directly.
Removed builder UI and state for unsupported legacy notification-channel and root option fields.
Updated automation list, card, and preset gallery consumers away from removed root automation and preset fields.
